      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Not much. Some mild discomfort on my right side, under the ribs. Sometimes. It's, um, more of a nagging than a pain.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:10",
      "end_timestamp": "01:21",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "A couple of times a week? After big meals, I guess. I haven't really...",
